                ["bookselar_link" => "","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/bimboilori---books---wellness-and-soundness-titles---digital?product=healthy-attitudes-digital-nsdwuo","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/all-books-by-bimbo-ilori?product=healthy-attitudes-paperback-ehtmqz","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/Healthy-Attitudes-Health-Through-Thoughts-ebook/dp/B0DHV43Y1Z?ref_=ast_author_dp&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.6cKLgh65MEY-bjMwj6d6P_kVe3dNzDjhajjZxCFsAXDqmZqaZ8Y-aCjvY88m8rLi-atsuoTDXoU_zqfqx0rBoKRCMV7zWKEnnIExpQsOGwso6FwxMLNYHdBrm8ehXNxK6t4YntzS6SrKG1sfOfsOjStVoHe-zL2PS0q_JWDzkn-iZvcQv1mklHmITZP644FNJCb60EKioBlHCQvpcvHMLUT2aYJgOYV30yNL54un-Qc.6PVFTpJuKBC-LSfH3yOvUEYSGOYJApk2IbmdyzNIVmw&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Healthy Attitudes", "image" => "category82.png", "description" => "Healthy Attitudes Life has primary provisions embedded in its systems to sustain us, independent of external efforts, as evidenced by the resilience of other living creatures. These inherent mechanisms serve as the fundamental keys to life and health. When we overlook them, we resort to secondary measures, which can be very helpful second chances. One such recourse is the healthcare interventions of oral medications. Healthy Attitudes emphasises the significance of innate psychological skills in managing and preserving our health, with minimal to no cost benefits. This approach demonstrates how health standards are attained through life encounters and expressions. Leveraging the power that converts life routines to medicines, living happily with overall well-being."],
