                "paystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles--paperback",
                "titles" => [
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/3m1q6z81nm","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles?product=life-wheels-uhktno","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles--paperback?product=life-wheels-paperback-srafdy","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/Life-Wheels-Aligning-Dimensions-Development-ebook/dp/B0GHZPGC7S?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Life Wheels", "image" => "category100.jpg", "description" => "Life Wheels Life is meant to be lived in balance, purpose, and alignment, yet so many struggle with feeling stuck, overwhelmed, or fragmented. Life Wheels presents a practical framework that helps you bring clarity, momentum, and harmony to every area of your life. Through seven interconnected wheels - Love, Prayer, Relationships, Career, Wellness, Purpose, and Fulfillment. This book shows you how to cultivate the foundations that make life work. Packed with reflection questions, actionable steps, contemporary insights, and scripture guidance, Life Wheels teaches you how to love well, pray effectively, build meaningful connections, excel in your work, maintain holistic wellness, pursue your God-given purpose, and experience true fulfillment. Each wheel is designed to move in harmony with the others, creating momentum and alignment that transform ordinary days into extraordinary living. Whether you are seeking clarity, balance, or breakthrough, this book equips you to spin your life wheels intentionally. When all your wheels turn together, your life flows with energy, purpose, and lasting impact. Life Wheels is your guide to living fully, thriving holistically, and achieving the extraordinary life God intended for you."],
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/q707132938","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles?product=what-so-you-want-oywimu","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles--paperback?product=what-do-you-want-paperback-mmxmkt","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/What-You-Want-Willingly-Development-ebook/dp/B0GHZYJT2Z?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "What Do You Want?", "image" => "category101.jpg", "description" => "What Do You Want? So many doors remain closed, not because the answer is “no,” but because the request was never made—or it was made poorly. This book is your guide to asking with clarity, confidence, and wisdom. You’ll discover practical keys that shift your requests from hesitant to irresistible, helping you gain results in prayer, business, and everyday relationships. Drawing from timeless principles and real-life insights, What Do You Want? shows you how to: Frame your requests in a way that honors the giver. Align your ask with purpose and mutual benefit. Present your needs with humility, gratitude, and confidence. Turn one-time favors into lasting connections. Whether you’re negotiating a deal, seeking support, or praying for breakthrough, this book will equip you to ask well—and never be turned down."],
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/a304690a3o","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles?product=optimized-digital-yzsxfe","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles--paperback?product=optimized-paperback-zjayen","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GHZNB9XF?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Optimised", "image" => "category102.jpg", "description" => "Optimized Every life carries immense potential yet so many go through their days reacting instead of intentionally shaping their future. Time slips away, energy drains unnoticed, and opportunities are missed not because of a lack of talent but because of unawareness and inefficiency. This book is about optimization. It guides you to understand yourself, your relationships, your environment, and your purpose so that you can take deliberate steps to maximize your impact and fulfillment. Through practical strategies on self-mastery, communication, energy management, productivity, and purposeful contribution you will learn how to live intentionally, act efficiently, and contribute meaningfully. By the end of this book you will have the tools to organize your life, conserve your energy, strengthen your relationships, and align every action with your greater mission. This is a guide to living fully, giving your best and making a difference in every area of your life."],
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/k2j521","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles?product=mentorship-memoirs-digital-zqsvka","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/spiritual-and-personal-development-titles--paperback?product=mentorship-memoirs-paperback-mnioir","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/Mentorship-Memoirs-Optimise-Outcomes-Development-ebook/dp/B0DNY5YLCX?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.tE9c2eomQ70kJBO5M285_w.p3JwRwLHxAgfFUsvI3P7uVH_V-9ZDEr1qXl0UvBWwV8&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Mentorship Memoirs", "image" => "category103.jpg", "description" => "Mentorship Memoirs In over three decades of leadership, one of the critical nudging quests and questions from people desirous of personal or career development has been who could or would guide and how? In this classic piece that supports progressive endeavours with intentionality, I have delved and dealt with the ropes and rungs that will help guide seekers to take informed and decisive steps towards progress and networking. Life in itself is not a competition, but people sometimes make it one. Mentorship is a culture that values growth, learning, and sharing. A culture that recognizes the power of relationships, the importance of feedback, and the impact of others on the road to self-discovery. I'm persuaded 'Mentorship Memoirs' will deliver the needed support and insight for growth and fulfilment in life purpose and development. It's my pleasure."],
