                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/36v61s","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--digital?product=the-insight-edge-tie-kleeph","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--paperback?product=the-insight-edge-tie--digital-","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/Insight-Edge-Understanding-insights-productivity-ebook/dp/B08J455MVN?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "The Insight Edge [TIE]", "image" => "category120.jpg", "description" => "Life is underserved if not lived consciously on all realms of being viz, the spirit, soul and body. TIE is more than a book because it is a tool that enables you to live the life you have been created for, wholly, in all spheres to your best. Showing you how to take advantage of the supernatural edge, as a renewed believer in Christ. You will find out how to recognise, comprehend and appropriate the insights of the Holy Spirit in the regulation and decisions of life, eliminating or minimising mistakes and misses. God leads not by reasoning but by revealing. Find out how leading revelations flow and how to deploy them. This content will impact your perceptions, decisions, and overall conduct. TIE is a highly recommended read."],
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/10224p03kk","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--digital?product=visions-and-dreams-unveiled-digital-cfewmh","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--paperback?product=visions-and-dreams-unveiled-paperback-pixbur","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/Visions-Dreams-Unveiled-Understanding-Messages-ebook/dp/B0GJTY43HL?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Visions and Dreams Unveiled", "image" => "category121.jpg", "description" => "Visions and Dreams Unveiled Visions and dreams are often misunderstood, ignored, or feared, yet they play an essential role in revealing what is happening in our minds, emotions, and spiritual lives. Whether they come as gentle reminders, symbolic messages, or intense encounters, they help us understand ourselves and navigate the world with greater clarity. Visions and Dreams Unveiled offers a simple yet comprehensive guide to understanding why you dream, what your dreams mean, and how to respond to them. This book blends biblical wisdom, real-life stories, and helpful principles to show you how to interpret symbols, discern the source of a dream, and gain insight from both night messages and daytime visions. If you’ve ever wondered, “Why did I see this?” or “What is God saying?”, this book provides the understanding you need. Clear, relatable, and deeply insightful, it will help you turn confusing experiences into purposeful revelation and spiritual growth"],
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/e51281h349","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--digital?product=rejection-isnt-about-you-digital-ijamnh","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--paperback?product=rejection-isnt-about-you-paperback-zsvnsr","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/Rejection-Isnt-About-You-Reclaiming-ebook/dp/B0GJLR1956?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Rejection Isn’t About You ", "image" => "category122.jpg", "description" => "Rejection Isn’t About You Rejection is not a verdict - it is a redirection. In Rejection Isn’t About You: Recast the Race, Reclaim Your Space, Bimbo Ilori reveals the hidden forces behind dismissal, opposition, and pushout, showing readers how to rise above every setback with clarity, faith, and purpose. Drawing on biblical examples like David, Joseph, and Jesus, as well as contemporary stories of triumph, this book demonstrates that rejection often precedes divine promotion and extraordinary influence. This guide is more than encouragement - it is a roadmap. Readers will learn to recognize the energy behind rejection, break the cycles of bitterness, reclaim their identity, and strategically step into the spaces God has prepared for them. With practical steps, reflection questions, and spiritual insights, it equips individuals to transform obstacles into opportunities and setbacks into springboards for greatness. Whether you have faced rejection from family, teachers, colleagues, or society, this book offers a clear message: your pushout is preparation, your trials are training, and your destiny is unstoppable. Recast your race. Reclaim your space. Rise victoriously."],
                ["bookselar_link" => "https://selar.com/21671kd2s0","bookpaystackdigital_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--digital?product=ousted-digital-tlzwhwhttps://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--digital?product=ousted-digital-tlzwhw","bookpaystack_link" => "https://paystack.shop/the-insight-series--paperback?product=ousted-sxzbqa","bookamazon_link" => "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GJVPBM6Z?ref_=ast_author_dp_rw&th=1&psc=1&dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.PdPOdrcKXmmF-C8ZNWyIbZv5zgr4KLz94OXafGIM-r7O_pkpIkTLbHi76FRK0CkUOPXGWdDWJ4rM2Vrmb7gTGufkApShLv6bzcR8G3SUr6dCadl0rBdSETgSqietKEpgdAq-vepjNQXxbvPCBpTM_O13j7oKYcODSd6eK3geE4fd7Djf21B5gUcXokFVraCigu9itf0WPaQcrYW9Yks6hil1EF7iMdmISq30nM4_6Pg.2QKmM_jlPskshLLj7V2GYm7mqGKoVWYu8ms1niy6HCk&dib_tag=AUTHOR","title" => "Ousted!", "image" => "category123.jpg", "description" => "Ousted! How to Outsmart, Outlast, and Sail Through Opposition is a strategic and spiritually grounded guide for anyone navigating seasons of resistance, pressure, or unseen battles. Drawing from rich biblical insight and practical wisdom, this book unveils the patterns of opposition and equips you with tools to discern, respond, and advance with clarity. You will learn how to move early, stay discreet when needed, build wisely, maintain spiritual authority, and position yourself for God-led breakthroughs. More than a manual for survival, Ousted! is a roadmap for victorious living. Each chapter reveals how to apply divine strategies in real time, whether you’re confronting internal struggles, external resistance, or subtle spiritual pressures. Through relatable examples and actionable steps, you will discover how to strengthen your spiritual posture, sharpen your sensitivity to divine instruction, and persist until the opposition breaks. Ultimately, this book leads you to the highest dimension of victory: the moment when God Himself steps in to overturn, uproot, and oust what has resisted you. Ousted! empowers you to walk with confidence, execute with wisdom, and sail forward knowing that every battle has an expiration date and God always has the final say."],
